# Notices for Eclipse Oniro for OpenHarmony — libhybris

This repository is a fork of the upstream [libhybris](https://github.com/libhybris/libhybris)
project, maintained at the Eclipse Foundation as part of Eclipse Oniro for
OpenHarmony. It carries the OpenHarmony adaptation of libhybris: an OHOS GN
build, an `ohos` EGL platform backend, and bring-up fixes for running
bionic-based vendor HAL binaries under OHOS musl.

* https://projects.eclipse.org/projects/oniro.oniro4openharmony

